Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:43.00,ChannelTag,,0,0,0,,  RADITYA DIKA · AUTO CLIP  
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:43.00,TitleCard,,0,0,0,,Dokter Tirta Curhat Dendam Masa Lalu!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:43.00,HookFooter,,0,0,0,,Ternyata Dokter Tirta masih dendam sama kejadian 6 bulan lalu! Siapa nih yang ikut ngerujak
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.50,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,tim bola.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,0:00:01.20,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0038BDF8&}Saya{\c&H00FFFFFF&} juga kok.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.10,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Oh ya? Lah lu {\c&H0038BDF8&}doang{\c&H00FFFFFF&} yang.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.50,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0038BDF8&}Padahal{\c&H00FFFFFF&} pas. Iya.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.50,0:00:09.40,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Oke saya juga pas {\c&H0038BDF8&}terakhir{\c&H00FFFFFF&} ngikutin ada orang kemarin kayaknya kalah 4-1 kayaknya.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.30,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,4-1 {\c&H0038BDF8&}Kasian{\c&H00FFFFFF&} ya.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.70,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0038BDF8&}tetangga{\c&H00FFFFFF&} tapi saya nggak mau bahas karena kasihan.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.70,0:00:12.20,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Kasian itu.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.50,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Ya namanya juga kan {\c&H0038BDF8&}pertandingan{\c&H00FFFFFF&} bola.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.00,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Betul {\c&H0038BDF8&}kadang{\c&H00FFFFFF&} menang,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.20,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,kadang kalah. Ya kan {\c&H0038BDF8&}Liverpool{\c&H00FFFFFF&} juga pernah ngalamin itu.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.30,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Ya kan ada yang {\c&H0038BDF8&}ngerujak{\c&H00FFFFFF&} saya, saya ingat ya.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.30,0:00:24.80,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Saya masih dendam ya. 6 bulan lalu Anda membuat saya viral {\c&H0038BDF8&}gara-gara{\c&H00FFFFFF&} kayak gitu.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.80,0:00:25.60,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Liverpool.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.60,0:00:26.80,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Saya {\c&H0038BDF8&}bilang{\c&H00FFFFFF&} apa?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.00,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Ngecek.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.00,0:00:33.10,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Oh tim yang kalah sama oh {\c&H0038BDF8&}Brentford{\c&H00FFFFFF&} papan bawah saya ingat.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.20,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Ingat dendam.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.20,0:00:37.00,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Saya ingat ya. {\c&H0038BDF8&}Dendam.{\c&H00FFFFFF&} Dendam man juga ya.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.00,0:00:39.60,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,Iya, {\c&H0038BDF8&}dendam.{\c&H00FFFFFF&} Saya ingat saya sudah pakai kostum lebah ya.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.60,0:00:43.00,SubtitleBox,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0038BDF8&}Lihat,{\c&H00FFFFFF&} saya janji, saya janji satu hal.
